Fixture wsse-ncanode.xml is extracted without changes (apart from a trailing newline) from NCANode WsseServiceTest.groovy at commit 0adab29a7d30c181d70e8cc6b4f243122f50c3b8.
Source: https://github.com/ncanode-kz/NCANode/blob/0adab29a7d30c181d70e8cc6b4f243122f50c3b8/src/test/groovy/kz/ncanode/unit/service/WsseServiceTest.groovy
The companion wsse-legacy-rsa-sha1.xml reuses that public SOAP body as a bounded verification-only fixture; its certificate and RSA-SHA1 signature are independently generated from this repository's public synthetic user-rsa-sign test key. No production key material is included.

